    "title": "Expected Symptoms",
    "instruction_body": " It is normal for the head of the penis to be blue/cold while in the clamp.\n?Discomfort is normal while using traction, particularly during the first 1-2 weeks of use.\n? A small amount of decreased sensation is also normal during the treatment duration.\n? Mild skin sensitivity from use of penile wraps is common.\n? Discontinue use and contact your medical provider if you have any moderate or severe symptoms or symptoms which are persistent after discontinuing traction.",
